[{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0033","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-0146","title":"Microsoft Windows SMBv1 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows SMBv1 服务器存在远程代码执行漏洞（EternalBlue/MS17-010）。攻击者可通过向目标系统的 SMBv1 服务发送特制数据包，利用 SMB 协议解析过程中的内存处理缺陷触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8.1、Windows Server 2012 Gold/R2、Windows RT 8.1、Windows 10 Gold/1511/1607 及 Windows Server 2016 等多个版本。攻击者无需用户交互即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。该漏洞被广泛用于 WannaCry、NotPetya 等勒索软件的大规模传播，造成全球性破坏。Microsoft 已于 2017 年 3 月安全更新（MS17-010）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-0146"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-03-17T00:59:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:57:09Z","remediation":"立即安装微软 2017 年 3 月安全公告 MS17-010 对应补丁，各 Windows 版本补丁编号为 KB4012212/KB4012215/KB4012216/KB4012606/KB4013198。如无法打补丁，在防火墙/安全组中阻止 TCP 445/139 端口入站流量，并禁用 SMBv1 协议（通过 PowerShell 执行：Set-SmbServerConfiguration -EnableSMB1Protocol $false）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154690/DOUBLEPULSAR-Payload-Execution-Neutralization.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156196/SMB-DOUBLEPULSAR-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96707","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1037991","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-701903.pdf","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-966341.pdf","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSMA-18-058-02","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-0146","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41891/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41987/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43970/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-0146","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-0146.md","https://github.com/SecWiki/windows-kernel-exploits/blob/2b944b52ee30f8833a21f0805d26