2017-0143","title":"Microsoft Windows SMBv1 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows SMBv1 服务器存在远程代码执行漏洞（EternalBlue/MS17-010），攻击者可通过向目标系统的 SMBv1 服务发送特制数据包，在无需用户交互的情况下触发漏洞，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows Vista SP2、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8.1、Windows 10、Windows Server 2008/2012/2016 等多个版本。由于 SMB 协议在处理畸形请求时存在内存损坏问题，攻击者可利用该漏洞完全控制目标系统，安装程序、查看/更改/删除数据或创建新账户。该漏洞曾被 WannaCry 勒索软件大规模利用，造成全球性危害。Microsoft 已在 2017 年 3 月安全更新（MS17-010）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-0143"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-03-17T00:59:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:57:09Z","remediation":"立即安装微软 2017 年 3 月安全更新 MS17-010（KB4012212/4012213/4012214/4012215/4012216/4012606），对应各 Windows 版本。如无法打补丁，在组策略或注册表中禁用 SMBv1 协议（设置 `HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\LanmanServer\\Parameters\\SMB1` 为 0），并在防火墙阻断 445/TCP 端口的入站流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154690/DOUBLEPULSAR-Payload-Execution-Neutralization.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156196/SMB-DOUBLEPULSAR-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96703","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1037991","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-701903.pdf","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-966341.pdf","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSMA-18-058-02","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-0143","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41891/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41987/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43970/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-0143","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-0143.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2017-0143/README.md","https://github.com/nmap/nmap/blob/e2265fe97cb73990727052f32be15d85f82aceb6/scripts/smb-vuln-ms17-010.nse","https://github.c