Explorer 9 至 11 版本中存在信息泄漏漏洞。当 IE 浏览器处理特制网页时，未能正确限制对进程内存中敏感数据的访问，导致攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网站的方式，从浏览器进程内存中获取敏感信息。该漏洞为信息泄漏类型，攻击者需要诱使用户点击恶意链接或访问恶意网页，无法远程直接利用。Microsoft 已在 2017 年 3 月安全更新 MS17-007 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2017-0059"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-03-17T00:59:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:56:59Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2017 年 3 月安全更新 MS17-007，该更新修复了 Internet Explorer 内存信息泄露漏洞。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新，或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载安装。临时缓解措施：将 Internet Explorer 安全级别设为高，禁用活动脚本。建议升级到 Microsoft Edge 以获得更安全的浏览体验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96645","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038008","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-0059","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41661/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42354/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43125/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-0059","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43125","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-0059.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2017/0xxx/CVE-2017-0059.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-0059","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2017/0xxx/CVE-2017-0059.json","https://github.com/tanjiti/sec_profile/blob/26841ec64b9b7f07c07c4acb3ddbb6b2b5b25604/data/secwiki/177_week.html","https://github.com/ajinabraham/Droid-Application-Fuzz-Framework/blob/c8c3d2a0d9ad23deea79febd59c55552090f5d73/generators/html/domato/README.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-0059.csv","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/C