ows Update 自动获取。由于该漏洞已被 CISA KEV 收录且存在在野利用，无法立即打补丁的系统应限制非管理员用户登录并启用 AppLocker 阻止可疑 GDI 调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96033","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038002","https://blogs.technet.microsoft.com/mmpc/2017/03/27/detecting-and-mitigating-elevation-of-privilege-exploit-for-cve-2017-0005/","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-0005","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-0005","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-0005.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2017/CVE-2017-0005.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2017-0005/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-0005","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2017/0xxx/CVE-2017-0005.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-0005.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-0005.md","https://github.com/fr0gger/jupyter-collection/blob/865db39181aa6e6d77ef91fb4b9fadca2f22a29f/RAG_ATT&CK/knowledge/ZIRCONIUM.md","https://github.com/trietptm/Security-News/blob/e46fe769bfa56f60b70561bb4b637851150da4d0/Twitter/Zube/2017/2017_03_28.txt","https://github.com/783cc003ed/catalogue01/blob/dbe5c25acbf77955364002252fa305684a634652/2017/digest-2017-03.md","https://github.com/sheri31/0005poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0003","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-0001","title":"Microsoft Windows GDI 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 图形设备接口（GDI）存在本地特权提升漏洞，低权限本地用户可通过运行特制应用程序触发该漏洞，从而获取系统最高权限。该漏洞影响 Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8.1、Windows Server 2012 Gold/R2、Windows RT 8.1 及 Windows 10 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无法远程利用。Microsoft 已在 2017 年 3 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-0001"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-03-17T00:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:56:54Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 3 月安全更新 MS17-013。各系统对应补丁：Windows 7 SP1/Server 2008 R2 安装 KB4012212（仅安全）或 KB4012215（月度汇总）；Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 安装 KB4012213 或 KB4012216；Windows Server 2012 安装 KB4012214 或 KB4012217；Windows 10 安装 KB4012606（RTM）/KB4013198（1511）/KB4013429（1607）；Windows Vista/Server 2008 安装 KB4017018。安装后需重启系统。如无法立即打补丁，限制本地用户登录权限、以低权限账户运行应用程序作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96057","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038002","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-0001","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-0001","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-0001.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2017/0xxx/CVE-2017-0001.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-0001","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-0001.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-0001.csv","https://github.com/AlienVault-OTX/Threat-Trends/blob/0b3752b49dac4d9f2bb797ca061eb5f14d39fd37/getCveStats/cves.txt","https://github.com/dodger487/scrape_hn/blob/e32869e04292c70b37a11511272c441cabc478b8/stories/14305523.txt","https://github.com/grcninja/Small_Tasks/blob/386248eeabe3c47f1c0cc5227a025cd9d5c23e0f/cvedetails.py","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2017-0001.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0709","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0709.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-5638","title":"Apache Struts2 Jakarta Multipart 解析器远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Apache Struts2 的 Jakarta Multipart 解析器在处理文件上传请求时存在异常处理缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送特制的 Content-Type、Content-Disposition 或 Content-Length HTTP 头，触发 OGNL 表达式注入，从而在目标服务器上执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Struts2 2.3.5 至 2.3.31 及 2.5 至 2.5.10 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需任何认证，攻击复杂度低，已在 2017 年 3 月被大规模野外利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-5638"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-03-11T02:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:20:54Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apache Struts 2 至 2.3.32（2.3.x 分支）或 2.5.10.1（2.5.x 分支）及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可部署 WAF 规则拦截包含恶意 Content-Type 头部的请求，或禁用 Jakarta Multipart 解析器并切换至其他文件上传实现方式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.talosintelligence.com/2017/03/apache-0-day-exploited.html","http://blog.trendmicro.com/trendlabs-security-intelligence/cve-2017-5638-apache-struts-vulnerability-remote-code-execution/","http://www.arubanetworks.com/assets/alert/ARUBA-PSA-2017-002.txt","http://www.eweek.com/security/apache-struts-vulnerability-under-attack.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujul2017-3236622.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96729","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1037973","https://arstechnica.com/security/2017/03/critical-vulnerability-under-massive-attack-imperils-high-impact-sites/","https://cwik