ps://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-5638.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-5638.md","https://github.com/qazbnm456/awesome-cve-poc/blob/fc862e38e03ea68cdc62618d14891a426daff1a4/CVE-2017-5638.md","https://github.com/fofapro/vulfocus/blob/4b7a2eaacce4ed770f289e6e72f7240da1e16c74/writeup/CVE-2017-5638/CVE-2017-5638.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/d08f837f771e6cd83ec9c845b0c4f72f125cbe84/2017/CVE-2017-5638.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/6e3267700a6a68d4b849c870d5c00c67dc46e86a/data/by-cve/CVE-2017-5638.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-1635.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-5638.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2017/CVE-2017-5638.md","https://github.com/knownsec/pocsuite3/blob/9bed2883b86a8996f8805fc44da4a1911f52a11e/README.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/struts2/readme.md","https://github.com/Flyteas/Struts2-045-Exp","https://github.com/Z-0ne/ScanS2-045-Nmap","https://github.com/immunio/apache-struts2-CVE-2017-5638","https://github.com/jas502n/S2-045-EXP-POC-TOOLS"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0709.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0809","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0809.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6334","title":"NETGEAR DGN2200 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"NETGEAR DGN2200 系列路由器 dnslookup.cgi 接口存在 OS 命令注入漏洞，远程认证用户可通过向该接口发送特制的 HTTP POST 请求，在 host_name 字段中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）来执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞影响固件版本 10.0.0.50 及更早的 DGN2200v1/v2/v3/v4 设备，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。攻击者需先获取设备管理凭据，利用难度较低，成功利用后可完全控制目标路由器，进而窃取网络流量、发起中间人攻击或作为跳板攻击内网其他主机。NETGEAR 已发布固件更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6334"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-03-06T02:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:22:10Z","remediation":"NETGEAR DGN2200 系列设备已停止支持，官方不再发布固件更新。建议立即将设备从网络中断开并更换为仍在支持周期内的路由器。如无法立即更换，可在路由器管理界面中将 dnslookup.cgi 的访问权限限制为仅内网管理 IP，并在防火墙上阻断来自外网的 80/443 端口对设备管理页面的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96463","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41459/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41472/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42257/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-6334","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41472","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6334.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6334.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6334","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-6334.rules","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/16901ed3086419e92a3d59446e25736507cf6a0b/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6334.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-6334/README.md","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/27149.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6334.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-6334.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-6334.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0809.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0809.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0809.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0122","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0122.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6478","title":"paintballrefjosh MaNGOSWebV4 反射型跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"paintballrefjosh MaNGOSWebV4 4.0.8 版本前存在反射型跨站脚本攻击漏洞，漏洞位于 install/index.php 文件的 step 参数处理逻辑中。由于缺乏输入验证和输出编码，攻击者可构造包含恶意脚本的 step 参数值，诱导用户访问特制链接触发反射型 XSS 攻击。该漏洞影响 MaNGOSWebV4 4.0.8 之前版本（paintballrefjosh 分支），CVSS 3.1 评分 6.1（MEDIUM），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N）但需要用户交互（UI:R），作用域改变（S:C），机密性和完整性影响低（C:L/I:L），可用性无影响（A:N）。攻击者需诱导管理员或用户点击恶意链接，在用户浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，可窃取会话 Cookie、执行敏感操作或钓鱼攻击。修复版本为 4.0.8，建议升级至最新版本并实施输入验证与输出编码防护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6478"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-03-05T20:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:22:25Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 MaNGOSWebV4 至 4.0.8 或更高版本（https://github.com/paintballrefjosh/MaNGOSWebV4/releases/tag/4.0.8）。如暂时无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面拦截 install/index.php 的 step 参数中的脚本载荷，或临时禁用安装页面访问作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96584","https://github.com/MarkLee131/awesome-web-pocs/blob/main/CVE-2017-6478.md","https://github.com/paintballrefjosh/MaNGOSWebV4/issues/15","https://github.com/paintballrefjosh/MaNGOSWebV4/releases/tag/4.0.8","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52457","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-6478.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6478.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/c9097bc88f77c877a08830c8bb997e760d5172eb/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-6478.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6478.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-6478.json","https://github.com/MarkLee131/awesome-web-pocs/blob/3643f9f6e8853e1405b65f3952d285d265be7cab/CVE-2017-6478.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6478","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-6478.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2017/CVE-2017-6478.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2017-6478.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-6478_3.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0122.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0119","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0119.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-5982","title":"Kodi Chorus2插件目录遍历漏洞","description":"Kodi Chorus2 2.4.2 插件存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22），攻击者可通过在 image 路径参数中构造双重 URL 编码的路径遍历序列 %2E%2E%252e（即 ..%2f）绕过路径验证，实现任意文件读取。该漏洞影响 Kodi 媒体中心安装了 Chorus2 2.4.2 版本插件的所有版本，CVSS 3.0 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N）和用户交互（UI:N），仅影响机密性（C:H）。攻击者可通过构造如 image/image%3A%2F%2F%2e%2e%252fetc%252fpasswd 的恶意请求读取服务器敏感文件（如 /etc/passwd），无需身份认证即可远程利用。官方已在后续版本中修复该路径遍历缺陷，建议升级 Chorus2 插件至最新版本或禁用该插件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-5982"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-02-28T18:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:21:33Z","remediation":"更新 Kodi Chorus2 插件到 2.4.2 及以上版本并禁用图片加载功能。如无法立即更新，可在 Kodi 设置中禁用或卸载 Chorus2 插件，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/141043/Kodi-17.1-Arbitrary-File-Disclosure.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2017/Feb/27","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96481","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2024/01/msg00009.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41312/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-5982.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-5982.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/c9097bc88f77c877a08830c8bb997e760d5172eb/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-5982.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2017-5982.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-5982-3041.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-5982-3039.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-5982-3042.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Kodi/CVE-2017-5982.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2017-5982.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2017-5982.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/881db81e73cc7e2f9f510b557401bea4324e5731/plugins/kodi/kodi/CVE-2017-5982.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0119.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0006","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-0037","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer/Edge 类型混淆远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 10/11 及 Microsoft Edge 浏览器的 mshtml.dll 中的 Layout::MultiColumnBoxBuilder::HandleColumnBreakOnColumnSpanningElement 函数存在类型混淆（Type Confusion）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的 CSS 令牌序列和操作 TH 元素的 JavaScript 代码，诱使用户访问特制网页触发该漏洞，成功利用后可实现远程代码执行，获取与当前用户相同的系统权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 7/8.1/10 及 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016 等平台，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。微软已于 2017 年 3 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-0037"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-02-26T23:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:56:57Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 3 月 Internet Explorer 累积安全更新 MS17-006（KB4013073）。Windows 7 SP1 用户安装 KB4012215（月度汇总）或 KB4012204（仅安全更新）；Windows 8.1 用户安装 KB4012216（月度汇总）或 KB4012204（仅安全更新）；Windows 10 用户安装 KB4012606（RTM）/KB4013198（1511）/KB4013429（1607）累积更新；Windows Server 2012 安装 KB4012217（月度汇总）或 KB4012204（仅安全更新）；Windows Server 2012 R2 安装 KB4012216（月度汇总）或 KB4012204（仅安全更新）；Windows Server 2016 安装 KB4013429 累积更新。如无法立即打补丁，可启用 Internet Explorer 增强安全配置（ESC）或使用 EMET 缓解工具降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96088","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1037905","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1037906","https://0patch.blogspot.si/2017/03/0patching-another-0-day-internet.html","https://bugs.chromium.org/p/project-zero/issues/detail?id=1011","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-0037","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41454/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42354/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43125/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-0037","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41454","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-0037.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2017/0xxx/CVE-2017-0037.json","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/securityaffairs_cve-2017-0037-microsoft-flaw.html.txt","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-0037","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2017/0xxx/CVE-2017-0037.json","https://github.com/LyleMi/dom-vuln-db/blob/5b15420a055776b09e149a00391e7af4017e6ca1/Edge/CVE-2017-0037.md","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/dos-poc/27112.txt","https://github.com/ajinabraham/Droid-Application-Fuzz-Framework/blob/c8c3d2a0d9ad23deea79febd59c55552090f5d73/generators/html/domato/README.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90___%E4%BA%8C%E8%BF%9B%E5%88%B6%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93.md","https://github.com/swimlane/soc-faker/blob/361c4ae88956878fbd8aaf5975044328556dfecd/socfaker/data/alert_names.txt","https://github.com/chattopadhyaykittu/CVE-2017-0037"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0006.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0006.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0800","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0800.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6077","title":"NETGEAR DGN2200 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"NETGEAR DGN2200 系列路由器固件版本 10.0.0.50 及更早版本的 ping.cgi 页面存在 OS 命令注入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向该页面发送特制的 HTTP POST 请求，在 ping_IPAddr 字段中注入 shell 元字符，从而以设备权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 DGN2200v1/v2/v3/v4 等多个硬件版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可完全控制目标设备。目前已有公开的 Exploit-DB 利用代码，建议用户立即升级固件或禁用远程管理功能。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6077"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-02-22T23:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:21:45Z","remediation":"NETGEAR 已停止为 DGN2200 系列提供固件更新，建议立即更换为受支持的设备。如无法更换，可在路由器管理界面中禁用\"远程管理\"功能，并将管理页面仅绑定到内网 IP；在防火墙层面限制对 DGN2200 的 80/443 端口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 段访问；同时监控 ping.cgi 接口的异常 POST 请求以检测利用行为。","status":"completed","collect